# 仓库属性
# 统一换行，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py   text diff=python
*.md   text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.jsx  text
*.js   text
*.css  text
*.svg  text

# 二进制
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 语言统计：文档不计入代码量
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md   linguist-documentation

# 示例审计包必须保持字节原样：manifest.json 里存了每个文件的 SHA-256，
# 一旦被换行转换改写，verify.py 的完整性校验就会失败。
examples/** -text
